{%- comment -%} Mobile Search Overlay — BEM, đồng bộ settings desktop search {%- endcomment -%}
<div class="search-overlay" id="mb-search-popup" aria-hidden="true">

  {%- comment -%} Header: Back ← · Form (input + clear X) · Submit icon {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="search-overlay__header">

    <button class="search-overlay__back" id="mb-search-close" type="button" aria-label="Quay lại">
      <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M19 12H5"/><path d="M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
      </svg>
    </button>

    <form class="search-overlay__form" action="/search" method="get" id="mb-search-form">
      <input
        type="text"
        name="query"
        id="mb-search-input"
        class="search-overlay__input"
        placeholder="Tìm sản phẩm, thương hiệu..."
        autocomplete="off"
        spellcheck="false"
        enterkeyhint="search"
      >
      <input type="hidden" name="type" value="product">
      <button type="button" class="search-overlay__clear" id="mb-search-clear" aria-label="Xóa" hidden>
        <svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 10 10" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M9.13.87L5 5 .87.87.87.87 0 1.74l.01.01L4.13 5 0 8.88l.87.87L5 5.87l4.13 4.13.87-.87L5.87 5 9.13 1.74z"/>
        </svg>
      </button>
    </form>

    <button type="submit" form="mb-search-form" class="search-overlay__submit" aria-label="Tìm kiếm">
      <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M11.742 10.344a6.5 6.5 0 1 0-1.397 1.398h-.001c.03.04.062.078.098.115l3.85 3.85a1 1 0 0 0 1.415-1.414l-3.85-3.85a1.007 1.007 0 0 0-.115-.1zM12 6.5a5.5 5.5 0 1 1-11 0 5.5 5.5 0 0 1 11 0z"/>
      </svg>
    </button>

  </div>

  {%- comment -%} Body: Promo · Recent · Suggest {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="search-overlay__body">

    {%- comment -%} 14/11/2026 (chủ dự án): GỠ banner khuyến mãi (.coupon_search / header_search_gg_*) khỏi popup tìm kiếm mobile. Desktop (header.bwt) và các field cấu hình giữ nguyên. {%- endcomment -%}

    {%- comment -%} Lịch sử tìm kiếm — JS render từ localStorage {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="search-overlay__section" id="mb-recent" style="display:none">
      <p class="search-overlay__section-label">Tìm kiếm gần đây</p>
      <ul class="search-overlay__recent-list" id="mb-recent-list"></ul>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} Đề xuất phổ biến — từ settings, horizontal scroll {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if settings.header_search_suggest and settings.header_search_suggest_list != blank -%}
    <div class="search-overlay__section">
      <p class="search-overlay__section-label">
        {%- if settings.header_search_suggest_title != blank -%}
          {{ settings.header_search_suggest_title }}
        {%- else -%}
          Đề xuất phổ biến
        {%- endif -%}
      </p>
      <div class="search-overlay__tags" id="mb-suggest-tags">
        {%- assign mb_keywords = settings.header_search_suggest_list | split: ',' -%}
        {%- for mb_kw in mb_keywords -%}
          {%- assign mb_kw_clean = mb_kw | strip -%}
          {%- if mb_kw_clean != blank -%}
          <a class="search-overlay__tag" href="/search?query={{ mb_kw_clean | url_encode }}&type=product">{{ mb_kw_clean }}</a>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
    </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%} Kết quả smart search AJAX — JS render, ẩn khi không có query {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if settings.header_search_smart -%}
    <div class="search-overlay__smart" id="mb-smart-results" style="display:none">
      <div class="list-search list-search-style" id="mb-list-search"></div>
      <div class="list-search2 list-search-style" id="mb-list-search2"></div>
    </div>
    {%- endif -%}

  </div>
</div>
